<title>MEXICO: Texas to Mexico livestock export update - USDA.</title>
<headline>Texas to Mexico livestock export update - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Weekly livestock movement update of Texas exports to Mexico, to March 3 - USDA.</p>
<p>(Livestock per head, year in Jan/Dec calendar year)</p>
<p>	Beef			 Week	    Year    Year Ago</p>
<p>    Slaughter		     202	  23,827	 6,445</p>
<p>    Breeding males		 67	     557	   173</p>
<p>    Breeding females	    115	   1,293	   223</p>
<p>	Hogs			 Week	     Year   Year Ago</p>
<p>    Slaughter			 0	     410	26,419</p>
<p>    Breeding males		 12	     133	    20</p>
<p>    Breeding females	    288	   1,303	   287</p>
<p>	Dairy			Week	     Year   Year Ago</p>
<p>    Breeding males		  0		45	     9</p>
<p>    Breeding females		0		99	     0</p>
<p>((--Chris Aspin, Mexico City newsroom (525) 7289530.</p>
<p>E-mail at chris.aspin@reuters.com))</p>
